# Captured from a cTrader broker's demo (2026-11-14), protobuf port 5035:
# the answer to a spot subscription of XAUUSD (41) with
# subscribeToSpotTimestamp, listing the symbol subscribed (cTrader's
# demos of two brokers answered EURUSD's (1) alike, each symbol asked
# listed).
# Scrubbed: ctidTraderAccountId replaced by the fake 1000001.
# The .bin is the payload; this is its text form, from:
#   protoc -I ../proto --decode=ProtoOASubscribeSpotsRes OpenApiMessages.proto < subscribe_spots_res.bin
# Message: ProtoOASubscribeSpotsRes
ctidTraderAccountId: 1000001
subscribedSymbolId: 41
